      "Reproduce the GLB byte for byte and validate it with Khronos glTF Validator 2.0.0-dev.3.10.",
      "Convert the reviewed GLB twice with Qt Balsam 6.8.3 and compare every generated byte.",
      "Import the GLB and render fixed chase, overhead and three side audit views at 47 degree FOV."
    ]
  },
